	(text "Each J is one LM3916 meter board, wired to this board by hand. Jn pins 2k-1 / 2k = K / A of meter-board LED k\n(k = 1 at -20 dB ... k = 11 CLIP). The J footprint copies the meter board LED-hole pattern (2.54 mm across, 4 mm rows)."
